  383 $@15: ε

  384 $@16: ε

  385 $@17: ε

  386 $@18: ε

  387 for_loop: tFOR $@15 tSYMBOL tEQU $@16 expression tTO expression step_part $@17 statement_list $@18 next next_symbol

  388 next: tEOPROG
  389     | tNEXT
